  description: 'Activate this card by sending your entire hand to the GY; banish
    5 Spells/Traps from your Deck. Each time your opponent activates a Spell Card,
    place 1 Chronicle Counter on this card when that Spell Card resolves. You can
    remove 2 Chronicle Counters from this card; your opponent chooses 1 card banished
    by this card''s effect for you to add to your hand. If this face-up card in the
    Spell & Trap Zone leaves the field: You take 500 damage for each card currently
    banished by this card''s effect.'
